==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~16 seconds<sup>200f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s (100%) spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s (150%) spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
In the monthly stage world, this one is tough. Using cats that can affect any trait, such as [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Magica Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] can help with conquering all the enemies in the stage. Bring many meatshields, such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], along with attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon cat]] to deal with the stronger enemies.

